        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "fcd8c30e-185b-5245-a8df-58729f355f9a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2012 Copa del Rey Final, 2010–11 Copa del Rey\n- Organizations: Athletic Bilbao, Barcelona, Real Madrid\n- Places: Vicente Calderón, Madrid, Estadio Mestalla, Valencia\n\nFacts:\n- The 2010–11 Copa del Rey began on 21 August 2010.\n- The 2010–11 Copa del Rey ended on 20 April 2011 with the final at the Estadio Mestalla in Valencia.\n- Real Madrid won the 2010–11 Copa del Rey by beating Barcelona 1–0 after extra time in the final.\n- Real Madrid’s 2010–11 Copa del Rey title was the eighteenth Copa del Rey trophy in the club’s history.\n- The 2012 Copa del Rey Final was contested by Athletic Bilbao and Barcelona on 25 May 2012.\n- The 2012 Copa del Rey Final was played at the Vicente Calderón in Madrid.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
