        "original_id": "64e95854-b22d-5429-b307-493b0449925f",
        "text": "Page: 2012 Copa del Rey Final. Sentence: The match was contested by Athletic Bilbao and Barcelona on 25 May 2012 at the Vicente Calderón in Madrid.\nPage: 2010–11 Copa del Rey. Sentence: The competition began on 21 August 2010 and ended on 20 April 2011 with the final, held at the Estadio Mestalla in Valencia, in which Real Madrid lifted the trophy for the eighteenth time in their history with a 1–0 victory over Barcelona in extra time.",
